# ── Generated agent-CLI config dirs ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Canonical, committed source of truth is .agents/ (deliberately NOT ignored).
# Every per-CLI dir below is GENERATED from .agents/ — skills via `lnc`
# (symlink_dir_contents), agent files via link-agentfiles — by the mise `enter`
# hook. Never commit them; edit .agents/ instead.
.claude/
.gemini/
.codex/
.kimi/
.augment/
.openclaw/
.opencode/
.cursor/
.crush/

